From 0e3a61c5810f118b4a4864bb96b1faf6acbdc866 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWCH Phase 4 <phase4@openwch.local>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 04:49:11 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] riscv: configure WCH 12.2 multilib set

Generate the RISC-V multilib table with ISA spec 2.2 from the 42 entries represented by the WCH 12.2.0 recipe. Keep Zicsr explicit for the eight double-precision entries whose official directory names require it. Together with the configured default rv32imac/ilp32 tuple this reproduces the official 43-line selection surface byte for byte.

Recipe and output evidence: analysis/toolchain/phase4-baseline.md; tmp/phase4-evidence/wch-multilib-generator-input.txt; tmp/phase4-evidence/generated-t-elf-multilib-isa22; tmp/phase4-evidence/s1-official/multilib.txt.

gcc/ChangeLog:

	* config/riscv/t-elf-multilib: Regenerate from the WCH 12.2 ISA
	spec 2.2 recipe.
---
 gcc/config/riscv/t-elf-multilib | 103 +++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 83 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

